  "prefLabel": "He-W 806.84 Adult Category Verification of Shelter and Living Arrangement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 806.84 Adult Category Verification of Shelter and Living Arrangement.\n\n(a) Acceptable verification of living arrangement and assistance group size shall be the individual’s statement.\n\n(b) If questionable, the individual shall verify the living arrangement pursuant to He-W 806.83.\n\nSource. #13875, eff 2-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
